[
  {
    "source": "Opposing these actions places any candidate well outside of the American mainstream. We will attack Dukakis relentlessly on this point.",
    "zh": "反对这些行动将使任何候选人都远远脱离美国主流。我们将在这一点上不懈地攻击杜卡基斯。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4388@23/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4388@20/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4388@20/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "These were poorly thought out positions, and we will highlight that, but we should spend most of the campaign focusing on my own merits.",
    "zh": "这些都是经过深思熟虑的立场，我们将强调这一点，但我们应该将竞选活动的大部分时间都集中在我自己的优点上。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4389@24/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4389@21/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4389@21/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Reasonable people can disagree on the merits of these actions. We don't have much to gain by bringing them into the campaign.",
    "zh": "理性的人可能不同意这些行为的优点。让他们参与竞选并没有给我们带来太多好处。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4390@25/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4390@23/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4390@23/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This is yet another example of Dukakis's poor judgment when it comes to defending American values.",
    "zh": "这是杜卡基斯在捍卫美国价值观时判断失误的又一个例子。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4391@26/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4391@24/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4391@24/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I think we need to preserve a level of dignity in this campaign, and talking about things like sodomy and bestiality might be a little bit too far for some people.",
    "zh": "我认为我们需要在这场运动中保持一定程度的尊严，谈论鸡奸和兽交之类的事情对某些人来说可能有点太过分了。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4392@27/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4392@25/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4392@25/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The ACLU may be popular on some northeastern college campuses, but in most of the U.S. this association should be a millstone. We will obviously highlight it.",
    "zh": "美国公民自由联盟可能在东北部的一些大学校园中很受欢迎，但在美国大部分地区，这个协会应该是一个磨石。我们显然会强调它。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4393@28/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4393@26/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4393@26/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "People have different opinions about the ACLU. I won't go into it too much on this campaign.",
    "zh": "人们对 ACLU 有不同的看法。我不会在这次竞选中过多讨论。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4394@29/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4394@27/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4394@27/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I was absolutely not involved with these dealings at any point, and I was appalled to find out about them.",
    "zh": "我在任何时候都绝对没有参与这些交易，而且我对发现它们感到震惊。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4395@30/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4395@28/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4395@28/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I should have been more aware that something was going on, based on some meetings I attended, and I regret not doing more to stop this at the time.",
    "zh": "根据我参加的一些会议，我应该更加意识到正在发生的事情，我很遗憾当时没有采取更多措施来阻止这种情况。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4396@31/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4396@29/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4396@29/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Mr. Reagan's words are his own. I admire the President, but I would never go so far as to throw names at our opponent.",
    "zh": "里根先生的话是他自己的话。我钦佩总统，但我绝不会去指责我们的对手。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4397@32/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4397@30/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4397@30/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Reagan himself admitted he was only trying to tell a joke, which came off poorly. I think we should move on to other issues.",
    "zh": "里根本人承认他只是想讲一个笑话，但效果不佳。我认为我们应该继续讨论其他问题。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4398@33/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4398@31/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4398@31/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We're proud to have Dan Quayle on the ticket, and he will be making important appearances in key swing states this fall.",
    "zh": "我们很自豪丹·奎尔出现在竞选组合上，他将于今年秋天在关键摇摆州重要亮相。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4402@34/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The announcement of Quayle didn't go over quite like we wanted to. Let's have him campaign in safely Republican areas for the time being, until this furor subsides.",
    "zh": "奎尔的公告并没有像我们想要的那样进行。让我们暂时让他在安全的共和党地区竞选，直到这种愤怒平息。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4403@35/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "That's a ridiculous statement. Of course some partisan Democrats are making that case, but Mr. Quayle more than held his own.",
    "zh": "这是一个荒谬的说法。当然，一些有党派倾向的民主党人正在提出这一观点，但奎尔先生不仅坚持自己的观点。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4404@36/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We will run a heavily biographical campaign this fall, including ads which highlight my military service.",
    "zh": "今年秋天，我们将开展一场大量的传记活动，包括突出我的兵役经历的广告。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4405@37/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Obviously we'll mention this some, but our main focus will be on the here and now.",
    "zh": "显然我们会提到这一点，但我们的主要焦点将集中在此时此地。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4406@38/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need to do anything necessary to reduce the staggering rate of murder and violent crime in this country.",
    "zh": "我们需要采取一切必要措施来减少这个国家惊人的谋杀和暴力犯罪率。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4478@39/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4478@36/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4478@36/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4478@50/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4478@48/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4478@48/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4478@48/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe, if a state wishes to impose capital punishment, that it should have every right to do so.",
    "zh": "我相信，如果一个国家希望判处死刑，它应该完全有权这样做。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4479@40/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4479@37/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4479@37/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4479@51/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4479@49/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4479@49/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4479@49/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe that capital punishment is ineffective at reducing crime, and is not applied in an equal manner. I do not support the practice.",
    "zh": "我认为死刑对于减少犯罪无效，并且没有以平等的方式适用。我不支持这种做法。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4480@41/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4480@38/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4480@38/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4480@52/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4480@50/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4480@50/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4480@50/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "As President, I will do anything I can to cut income taxes further.",
    "zh": "作为总统，我将尽一切努力进一步削减所得税。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4481@42/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4481@39/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4481@39/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4481@53/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4481@51/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4481@51/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4481@51/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I hope that this isn't necessary, but it would be irresponsible to rule anything out at the present time.",
    "zh": "我希望这不是必要的，但目前排除任何可能性是不负责任的。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4483@44/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4483@41/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4483@41/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4483@55/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4483@53/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4483@53/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4483@53/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I think we can take limited steps to bring this trade back into balance, but in general we should celebrate the expansion of world trade with our allies.",
    "zh": "我认为我们可以采取有限的措施来使贸易恢复平衡，但总的来说，我们应该与我们的盟友一起庆祝世界贸易的扩张。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4489@45/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4489@45/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4489@45/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4489@56/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4489@54/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4489@54/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4489@54/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Our first resort should be to negotiate with Japan and take steps to enhance the competitiveness of American industry. But I wouldn't take anything off the table.",
    "zh": "我们的首要手段应该是与日本谈判并采取措施增强美国工业的竞争力。但我不会放弃任何事情。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4490@46/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4490@46/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4490@46/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4490@57/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4490@55/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4490@55/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4490@55/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We have taken too many steps to expand world trade without adequately protecting American workers from the consequences. I would definitely run a more protectionist Administration.",
    "zh": "我们为扩大世界贸易采取了太多措施，却没有充分保护美国工人免受后果影响。我肯定会领导一个更加保护主义的政府。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4491@47/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4491@47/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4491@47/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4491@58/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4491@56/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4491@56/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4491@56/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I will definitely take someone's views on the rights of the unborn into account when making judicial appointments.",
    "zh": "在任命司法人员时，我一定会考虑某人对未出生婴儿权利的看法。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4495@48/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4495@48/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4495@57/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "There is a lot more to jurisprudence than someone's belief on a small aspect of the abortion issue. My goal will be to appoint to most qualified judges available.",
    "zh": "法理学不仅仅只是某人对堕胎问题的一个小方面的看法。我的目标是任命最合格的法官。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4496@49/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4496@49/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4496@58/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "It's only right to consider a judge's views on the right to choose when making appointments.",
    "zh": "预约时考虑法官对选择权的看法才是正确的。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4497@50/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4497@50/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4497@59/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This is getting it completely backwards. American families have every right to defend themselves from America's crime epidemic.",
    "zh": "这完全倒退了。美国家庭完全有权保护自己免受美国犯罪流行的影响。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4501@51/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4501@51/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4501@54/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4501@59/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4501@60/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4501@60/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4501@57/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I would only support limited steps on this issue, like a ban on “cop killer” bullets. Overall, I'm an opponent of increased gun control.",
    "zh": "我只会支持在这个问题上采取有限的措施，例如禁止“警察杀手”子弹。总的来说，我反对加强枪支管制。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4502@52/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4502@52/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4502@55/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4502@60/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4502@61/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4502@61/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4502@58/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe that we need to consider any measure to reduce our nation's crime epidemic, including new gun control legislation.",
    "zh": "我认为我们需要考虑采取任何措施来减少我们国家的犯罪流行，包括新的枪支管制立法。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4503@53/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4503@53/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4503@56/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4503@61/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4503@62/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4503@62/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4503@59/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This program will be a centerpiece of our defense against the Soviet Union for many years to come.",
    "zh": "该计划将成为我们未来许多年防御苏联的核心。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4506@54/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4506@56/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We should be making every effort we can with this program, but if the Soviet Union were to offer sufficient concessions, it should certainly be a bargaining chip.",
    "zh": "我们应该尽一切努力实施这个计划，但如果苏联做出足够的让步，它肯定会成为讨价还价的筹码。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4507@55/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4507@57/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need to form a comprehensive energy strategy and re-implement price supports for domestic oil production.",
    "zh": "我们需要制定全面的能源战略并重新实施对国内石油生产的价格支持。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4511@56/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4511@58/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4511@59/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4511@62/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4511@63/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4511@63/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4511@62/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe that American companies should every right to bid on foreign oil contracts with our allies.",
    "zh": "我认为美国公司应该有权与我们的盟友竞标外国石油合同。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4512@57/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4512@59/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4512@60/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4512@63/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4512@64/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4512@64/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4512@63/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Cheap oil is an overall benefit to our economy. I think the majority of voters will understand that this fall.",
    "zh": "廉价石油对我们的经济有整体好处。我认为大多数选民今年秋天就会明白这一点。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4513@58/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4513@60/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4513@61/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4513@64/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4513@65/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4513@65/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4513@64/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need more funding for federal programs to mitigate the worst effects of this downturn.",
    "zh": "我们需要为联邦计划提供更多资金，以减轻这次经济衰退的最坏影响。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4514@59/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4514@61/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4514@62/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4514@65/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4514@66/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4514@66/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4514@65/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Unfortunately, the economics of farming cannot support the number of farmers who were borrowing money in the early 1980s.",
    "zh": "不幸的是，农业经济无法支持 20 世纪 80 年代初借钱的农民数量。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4515@60/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4515@62/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4515@63/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4515@66/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Glenn/answers_json/4515@67/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Gore/answers_json/4515@67/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Jackson/answers_json/4515@66/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need to increase the support for American agriculture by fighting for exports in our trade deals -- with the Soviet Union, Mexico, and elsewhere.",
    "zh": "我们需要通过在与苏联、墨西哥和其他国家的贸易协定中争取出口来增加对美国农业的支持。",
    "keys": [
      "1988_Bush_Quayle/answers_json/4516@61/description",
      "1988_Bush_Dole/answers_json/4516@63/description",
      "1988_Bush_Kemp/answers_json/4516@64/description",
      "1988_Dukakis_Bentsen/answers_json/4516@67/description",
